         "en": "<b>Length and review date</b>: three months at most, in a PKWTT <span class=\"ev ev-verify\">Verify</span>.",
         "id": "<b>Lama dan tanggal evaluasi</b>: paling lama tiga bulan, di PKWTT <span class=\"ev ev-verify\">Periksa</span>."
